sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant App as Lazee App
  participant SDK as Lazee SDK
  participant Registry as SessionRegistry
  participant Agent
  participant Contract as Allowed Contract
  participant Indexer

  User->>App: Configure DCA session
  App->>SDK: create session policy
  SDK-->>User: show permission preview
  User->>SDK: approve
  SDK->>Registry: store policy
  Registry-->>Indexer: SessionCreated event
  Agent->>Registry: execute with session
  Registry->>Registry: check cap, expiry, allowlists, revocation
  Registry->>Contract: execute allowed action
  Registry-->>Indexer: SessionExecuted event
  User->>App: Revoke session
  SDK->>Registry: revoke
  Registry-->>Indexer: SessionRevoked event
